@UA.Action.Freedom.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5100

### Liveness — the one route that needs no token.
GET {{UA.Action.Freedom.Api_HostAddress}}/health/live
Accept: application/json

### Readiness — checks SQL, blob, queue and OIDC discovery for real.
GET {{UA.Action.Freedom.Api_HostAddress}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json

### A token from the local Keycloak. Seed logins, all with password "password":
### admin (Administrator), operator (Dispatcher+Loader+Purchaser), groundofficer (GroundOfficer).
# @name token
POST http://localhost:8081/realms/freedom/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=freedom-app&client_secret=local-freedom-client-secret&username=admin&password=password&scope=openid

###
@access_token = {{token.response.body.access_token}}

### Vehicles — read is open to every operational role, write to Purchaser and Administrator.
GET {{UA.Action.Freedom.Api_HostAddress}}/vehicles?page=1&pageSize=50
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###
POST {{UA.Action.Freedom.Api_HostAddress}}/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "vin": "WDB9066331S0BDD01",
  "plate": "UA10ACT",
  "brand": "Mercedes-Benz",
  "model": "Sprinter",
  "year": 2014,
  "fuel": "Diesel",
  "transmission": "Manual",
  "weightKg": 2200
}

### People — read is open to every operational role, write is Administrator only.
GET {{UA.Action.Freedom.Api_HostAddress}}/people?page=1&pageSize=50
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### The dispatcher's shortlist for building driver teams.
GET {{UA.Action.Freedom.Api_HostAddress}}/people?driversOnly=true
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###
POST {{UA.Action.Freedom.Api_HostAddress}}/people
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "firstName": "Olena",
  "lastName": "Shevchenko",
  "dateOfBirth": "1988-04-12T00:00:00Z",
  "joined": "2024-02-24T00:00:00Z",
  "phone": "+447700900123",
  "isDriver": true,
  "committed": false
}

###
